\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qj                                                \b\fs28 First Day Fooling at University\b0\fs22\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1 The first day at university is always memorable for every student. It is a new beginning filled with excitement, curiosity, and nervousness. I had also imagined my first day to be full of introductions, new friends, and exploring the campus. However, I did not expect that it would also be a day full of fun and little tricks played by the seniors.\par
As I entered the university gate, I was amazed to see the huge buildings, green lawns, and busy students. I was wearing my best clothes and had prepared myself to make a good impression. Suddenly, a group of senior students stopped me and asked me to introduce myself in a funny way. At first, I was confused, but then I realized they were just trying to have fun with the new students.\par
They made me sing a song loudly in front of everyone. Some students had to dance, some were asked to speak like movie characters, and some were given funny names. Everyone was laughing, including me. It was a light-hearted way to welcome the juniors.\par
Although it was a bit embarrassing at first, the friendly attitude of the seniors made the atmosphere enjoyable. We all became comfortable quickly and started talking to each other. It helped us forget our nervousness and made our first day memorable.\par
In the end, the fooling on the first day turned into a sweet memory. It broke the ice between seniors and juniors and made us feel like a part of the university family. I will never forget that fun-filled day.\par
